flowchart TB
  AI[AI advisory request] --> Gateway[Explicit tool gateway contract]
  Gateway --> Allowlist[Allowlisted capability?]
  Allowlist -->|No| Deny[Fail closed + sanitized audit]
  Allowlist -->|Yes| Actor[Authenticated actor and permission]
  Actor --> Validate[Validated bounded input]
  Validate --> ReadTool[Permitted read/advisory tool]
  ReadTool --> Result[Sanitized result]
  blocked[Finance / compliance / SOC execution / database / cloud / deployment autonomous tools: prohibited] --- Gateway
